title: "Classica Codex AI translations"
abstract: "English translations, made by AI and labelled as such, of ancient and medieval texts with no published English: cited passages in Greek, Latin, Old Norse, Egyptian, Middle High German, Dante, Old French, Hebrew and Aramaic, and whole works in Latin and Greek. Translated by Claude (Anthropic), checked in whole or in part by Codex (OpenAI); not reviewed by a specialist."
